# Project structure

## Monorepo structure
This project is a monorepo using Turborepo (https://turbo.build/repo/docs). It stores all packages and apps in the `packages` and `apps` directories respectively.

## Package structure
This project uses many packages to keep the code organized. Each package is located in the `packages` directory and is named like `@repo/package-name` as defined in the `package.json` file. Packages are used to share code between apps and other packages.

### Key packages

- `@repo/backend`: The backend package for the project. This project is using Convex (https://www.convex.dev/) for the database. It contains the Convex schema, functions, and API routes.
- `@repo/ui`: The UI package for the project. This project is using Shadcn UI (https://ui.shadcn.com/) for the UI with Tailwind CSS (https://tailwindcss.com/). It contains the shared UI components and styles.
- `@repo/email`: The email package for the project. This project is using React Email (https://react.email/) for the email templates. It contains the email templates and functions.

## App structure
This project will have several apps to keep the code organized. Each app is located in the `apps` directory and is named like `app-name` as defined in the `package.json` file. Apps are used to run the project and can contain things like the landing page, the main app, the mobile app, the docs site etc.